# About
body=f'''<div class="page-body"><section><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">The department</div><h2>Models meet the world.</h2><p>IEOR combines theory, modelling and application with a systems view of engineering and operations. Its programs, research, sponsored projects, consulting and continuing education connect methods with decisions in transportation, manufacturing, services and more.</p><a class="button button-blue" href="/research/">Explore research</a></div><div class="image-frame"><img src="/assets/building.jpg" alt="IEOR department building at IIT Bombay" loading="lazy"></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap mini-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">1976–2026</div><h2>Our journey</h2><p>Established as an interdisciplinary program in 1976, IEOR marked fifty years in 2026. The department's history includes Professor P. G. Awate's reminiscences and a decade-wise account of its development.</p><a class="button button-blue" href="{ext('/our-jounrey')}">Read the full history</a></div><div><h2>Golden Jubilee</h2><p>The Golden Jubilee celebrations were inaugurated in September 2026, bringing the community together for a year of events and reflection.</p>{linklist([('Golden Jubilee inauguration',ext('/node/4069')),('News and events','/news-events/')])}</div></div></section><section><div class="wrap mini-grid"><div><h2>Visit and contact</h2><p>Room 105, First Floor, IEOR Building<br>IIT Bombay, Powai, Mumbai 400076, India</p><a class="button button-blue" href="/contact/">Contact the department</a></div><div><h2>Stay connected</h2>{linklist([('News archive',ext('/all_news')),('Announcements',ext('/all_announcements')),('Alumni engagement',ext('/node/3911'))])}</div></div></section></div>'''
